# --- portability cargo (founder directive 2026-10-24) ---------------------------
# The work must be resumable on any machine: research snapshots under sources/,
# the unique_slides originals every judge leg scores against, deck-03's banked
# HANDOFF.md, and the qa/ resume-bank text (transcripts, reports, dispatch scripts,
# payloads, measurement scripts). Raster under qa/ (renders/crops) stays disk-only:
# it is regenerable from the banked build scripts.
!videos/**/sources/**
!videos/**/unique_slides/**
